Iridium Version: 0.9a


=== Iridium ===

  Iridium is a static analysis framework for JavaScript Programs 📈.
  $ ./iridium <command>
  $ ./iridium js3
  $ ./iridium pika
  $ ./iridium iri
  $ ./iridium stats
  $ ./iridium help

Command List

  help   Display this information.
  js3    Generate JS3 file and print to stdout
  pika   Generate Iridium Pika-ge (package).
  iri    Generate Iridium file (.iri)

=== Setup ===

  Run `bash setup.sh`.

=== Run Typecheck ===
  `npx tsc -p tsCheck.json`
